    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The International Meeting for Simulation in Healthcare (IMSH) 2022 hosted by the Society for Simulation in Healthcare (SSH) was held on the 15th till 19th of January in Los Angeles, California. Being there to receive our accreditation provided the opportunity to present 4 abstracts: 1 workshop, 2 panel discussions and 1 poster presentation. These were on interprofessional education in simulation; mining a simulation centre's operational data; continuous professional development of simulation centre staff, and student partnership in simulation based education.",
